
# machine translated (Spanish), not yet reviewed by a person.

# Heading of the permission window, naming the app.
store-ask-title = Lo que puede usar { $app }

# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
# Under the list of switches in the permission window when one or more is on already.
store-ask-above-on = Cada interruptor muestra lo que está permitido ahora. Puedes cambiarlo más tarde en Aplicaciones, Permisos.

# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
# Under the list of switches in the permission window when all start off.
store-ask-above-off = Cada interruptor sigue desactivado hasta que lo pulses. Puedes cambiarlo más tarde en Aplicaciones, Permisos.

# Note under the list of switches, since a .deb names nothing it wants.
store-ask-worked-out = Deducido de la propia aplicación

# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
# Tip of the button that turns every switch on.
store-ask-allow-all = Permitir todo

# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
# Main button of the permission window that keeps the choices and closes it.
store-ask-keep = Conservar estas opciones

